#%RAML 1.0 ResourceType
usage: |
  Apply to a single-item resource such as /customers/{customerId}. Describes structure
  only — apply correlation-id and common-error-responses traits explicitly per method in
  the API root RAML, for the same reason noted in collection.raml.
description: A single <<resourcePathName|!singularize>>.
get?:
  description: Retrieve a single <<resourcePathName|!singularize>> by id.
put?:
  description: Update a single <<resourcePathName|!singularize>> by id.
delete?:
  description: Delete a single <<resourcePathName|!singularize>> by id.
